        "text": "You gather Rootbone.",
        "kind": "narration"
      },
      {
        "step": 75,
        "text": "A cutting gale whips through the peaks, carrying flecks of stone.",
        "kind": "event"
      },
      {
        "step": 75,
        "text": "At the end of the path worn into the scree, roots and bone rise to meet you.",
        "kind": "combat"
      },
      {
        "step": 95,
        "text": "You gather Ley Resin.",
        "kind": "narration"
      },
      {
