      },
      {
        "step": 105,
        "text": "You gather Rootbone.",
        "kind": "narration"
      },
      {
        "step": 107,
        "text": "The Brute's den is a nest of roots and old steel. Nomad steel. It has been eating patrols.",
        "kind": "event"
      },
      {
        "step": 108,
        "text": "Stone scrapes stone as something massive shifts in the dark.",
        "kind": "event"
      },
      {
        "step": 108,
        "text": "Two slate figures stand in the drag furrows, turned to face outward.",
        "kind": "combat"
      },
      {
