        "text": "You gather Rootbone.",
        "kind": "narration"
      },
      {
        "step": 150,
        "text": "Behind you the rope bridge sways and settles. It held. Your feet will remember which boards took your weight.",
        "kind": "event"
      },
      {
        "step": 150,
        "text": "The air tastes of ash and frost. Something in the hollow hisses your name.",
        "kind": "event"
      },
      {
        "step": 150,
        "text": "The curtain of dark at the hollow's edge has a seam. Two figures in grey thread stand either side of it and do not look at you.",
        "kind": "event"
      },
      {
        "step": 150,
        "text": "Two shapes pull loose from the scree, eyes like cold stars.",
